Polygonal plot with roads on two sides, approximately 23 metres along the east and 27 metres along the south. Registered acquisition describes the two-storey corner house. The internal road is within an approved subdivision, with approximately six metres of concrete carriageway and eight metres right of way. SAM reports orange planning zoning.

SAM reports common-area charges of approximately THB 18,000 per year as of 7 May 2024. This is dated information, not a confirmed current rate. Verify current fees, arrears and cost allocation with SAM and the juristic entity before purchase.

Residential surroundings within a large development. Source-listed nearby places are Wat Khruea Sattha Tham and Supharoek Market. From Rayong toward Sukhumvit on Si Racha–Nong Yai Bu Road, continue 2.5 kilometres after the Bangkok–Pattaya road junction, turn left into The Boulevard for 300 metres, then right into the soi for 200 metres; the property is on the right.

Building/interior photos display 12 October 2024. Twenty-nine images include street-corner views, covered yard, halls, rooms, kitchen, stairs, bathrooms, plot plans and map. Inspect current house condition, power, plumbing, roof and transfer inventory.

SAM showed direct purchase and this price on 11 September 2026. Contact 02-686-1888, sales@sam.or.th or LINE @samline, quoting 8Z6128, to confirm availability, price, viewing, common charges and terms.

